WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:03.436
-(AUDIENCE CHEERS, APPLAUDS)
-Thank you very much. All right.

00:00:03.436 --> 00:00:07.740
Please, we got an amazing show,
so shut up. (CHUCKLES)

00:00:07.807 --> 00:00:08.842
MAN IN AUDIENCE: Love you, Bill!

00:00:08.908 --> 00:00:10.010
I know, I love you too.

00:00:11.510 --> 00:00:13.379
But, uh, there's a lot
to talk about today.

00:00:13.445 --> 00:00:15.081
Congress is in chaos.

00:00:15.415 --> 00:00:17.584
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)
-(LAUGHS)

00:00:17.684 --> 00:00:19.919
No, it's not a repeat. I mean,
and that could be any show,

00:00:20.019 --> 00:00:20.953
but you saw--
heard what happened?

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:23.022
The Speaker of the House
got shit-canned.

00:00:24.023 --> 00:00:27.927
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHS, APPLAUDS)
-This has never happened.

00:00:27.994 --> 00:00:31.497
Yes, uh, Kevin McCarthy was--
he's from California.

00:00:31.564 --> 00:00:33.599
He was the Speaker of the House,
Republicans got rid of him.

00:00:33.666 --> 00:00:34.867
Well, actually, he made a deal

00:00:34.934 --> 00:00:37.136
with the Democrats
to keep the government open.

00:00:37.536 --> 00:00:38.904
Uh, and then they fired him.

00:00:38.971 --> 00:00:41.407
-(CHUCKLES)
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:00:41.474 --> 00:00:44.343
This guy has more knives
in his back than Britney Spears.

00:00:44.477 --> 00:00:46.880
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)

00:00:46.946 --> 00:00:50.383
What? We just--
We make little jokes here.

00:00:51.985 --> 00:00:53.786
No, but McCarthy's big sin,
of course,

00:00:53.853 --> 00:00:56.322
was working with the Democrats
to keep the government open

00:00:56.388 --> 00:00:57.523
which Republicans felt

00:00:57.590 --> 00:00:59.525
was dangerously close
to governing.

00:00:59.692 --> 00:01:02.995
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:01:03.062 --> 00:01:05.198
But, you know,
he is second in line.

00:01:05.331 --> 00:01:06.733
Do you know that?
The Speaker of the House.

00:01:07.266 --> 00:01:11.003
-That's-- No biggie.
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:01:11.070 --> 00:01:13.840
But that's how it works.
President, vice president,

00:01:13.906 --> 00:01:15.108
check with Matt Gaetz.

00:01:15.275 --> 00:01:20.613
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)
-That's how our-- (CHUCKLES)

00:01:20.713 --> 00:01:22.515
So... (CHUCKLES)

00:01:22.715 --> 00:01:25.118
Okay, so now they're looking
for the new Speaker.

00:01:25.218 --> 00:01:27.820
Uh, lot of Republicans
throwing their hat in the ring.

00:01:27.920 --> 00:01:29.756
Jim Jordan,
do you know this guy?

00:01:30.957 --> 00:01:32.358
Former wrestling coach.

00:01:32.558 --> 00:01:35.127
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:01:35.261 --> 00:01:37.963
The perfect preparation
for government work.

00:01:38.097 --> 00:01:40.934
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)

00:01:41.067 --> 00:01:43.636
And also, famous
because he never wears a jacket.

00:01:43.903 --> 00:01:45.804
-(CLICKS TONGUE) That's his--
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:01:45.871 --> 00:01:47.674
(CHUCKLES)

00:01:47.740 --> 00:01:49.308
Uh, Bob Menendez heard that,
he said,

00:01:49.375 --> 00:01:51.343
"Where do you keep
your gold bars?" (CHUCKLES)

00:01:51.443 --> 00:01:58.017
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHS, APPLAUDS)
-Uh...

00:01:58.084 --> 00:02:00.119
Well, we, I mean, we don't know
if it's gonna be him.

00:02:00.186 --> 00:02:01.587
Republicans don't know
who they want.

00:02:01.654 --> 00:02:04.056
They don't care
as long as they own the libs.

00:02:04.323 --> 00:02:06.425
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:02:06.492 --> 00:02:07.560
And the Democrats,

00:02:07.693 --> 00:02:10.162
they don't care who it is
as long as it's a Black lesbian.

00:02:10.329 --> 00:02:15.434
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)
-(CHUCKLES)

00:02:15.601 --> 00:02:17.937
Oh, we make little jokes,
please.

00:02:18.538 --> 00:02:20.606
But, uh, no,
the really big story this week,

00:02:20.673 --> 00:02:24.143
the substantial story,
is that even Biden now

00:02:24.377 --> 00:02:27.413
is admitting
that the migrant crisis is real.

00:02:27.880 --> 00:02:30.616
He said today,
"Fuck it, build the wall."

00:02:30.683 --> 00:02:33.886
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)
-I mean, I-- I-- (CHUCKLES)

00:02:33.953 --> 00:02:35.755
I thought I was getting punked.
I-- I--

00:02:36.122 --> 00:02:38.024
Well, you know,
there's an election coming up

00:02:38.257 --> 00:02:39.792
and he's gotta move
to the center.

00:02:39.992 --> 00:02:42.961
It was either that
or shoot up a case of Bud Light.

00:02:43.162 --> 00:02:49.602
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)
-Uh...

00:02:51.203 --> 00:02:53.773
But a lot of the Democrats
actually feel betrayed by this

00:02:53.873 --> 00:02:56.008
'cause it does go
against his campaign promises.

00:02:56.075 --> 00:02:58.143
I mean, they said,
"We know it's in our platform

00:02:58.210 --> 00:02:59.711
that it says
'secure the border,'

00:03:00.112 --> 00:03:01.647
but we didn't think
you'd actually do something

00:03:01.714 --> 00:03:03.349
-about it." (CHUCKLES)
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

